00:48:23.520 --> 00:48:27.680
Because you people think too much and you
develop all kinds of diseases with it.

00:48:27.680 --> 00:48:29.600
Thinking, thinking. It’s maddening.

00:48:29.600 --> 00:48:32.160
And where do you lead yourself? Nowhere.

00:48:32.160 --> 00:48:36.000
It’s a cocoon. You go on beating yourself
on the walls of the

00:48:36.000 --> 00:48:38.800
cocoon and again come back
like a rebound again.

00:48:38.800 --> 00:48:41.240
Why not get out of it?

00:48:41.240 --> 00:48:44.400
It’s not so easy.

00:48:44.400 --> 00:48:46.160
It’s the easiest for Me, I think so.

00:48:46.160 --> 00:48:47.280
For you, maybe, yes.

00:48:47.280 --> 00:48:49.440
No, no, but easiest for you also.

00:48:49.440 --> 00:48:54.560
You can because, so fed up,
people are so fed up now. So,

00:48:54.560 --> 00:48:56.720
if they want to be more fed up,
as you say.

00:48:56.720 --> 00:49:00.440
Fed up. Yes, yes. Certainly, that’s

00:49:00.440 --> 00:49:05.760
But you see, yes. But if they become more,
more fed up, I cannot encourage it anymore

00:49:05.760 --> 00:49:07.360
because I am a Mother.

00:49:07.360 --> 00:49:09.600
I would not like you to be more fed up,
because in

00:49:09.600 --> 00:49:13.360
that you’ll be losing more people.

00:49:13.360 --> 00:49:15.120
We have already lost so many.

00:49:15.120 --> 00:49:18.080
What just happened,
the explosion in Russia

00:49:18.080 --> 00:49:22.160
with the atomic factory,
that was one thing. Also,

00:49:22.160 --> 00:49:25.360
