what do you think about it?

00:49:25.360 --> 00:49:30.320
That’s what just God’s doing. Because,
you see, you need shocks. You see,

00:49:30.320 --> 00:49:34.400
people were sitting,
squatting against this nuclear weapon,

00:49:34.400 --> 00:49:38.400
this, that, and you had here
demonstration of no value.

00:49:38.400 --> 00:49:42.000
One Chernobyl is sufficient
now to put one shock.

00:49:42.000 --> 00:49:44.240
Another one you need in America.

00:49:44.240 --> 00:49:47.440
Then it will stop automatically.

00:49:47.440 --> 00:49:53.840
But what can an average citizen
like me or like you do, who lives here?

00:49:53.840 --> 00:49:56.560
What do you think is
necessary to stop this?

00:49:56.560 --> 00:50:02.080
Leave it to God. Again.
It was work of God.

00:50:02.080 --> 00:50:06.880
Yes, sure, but what can I do or not,
or stop doing, maybe?

00:50:06.880 --> 00:50:11.760
You see, you are worried about things
which are not under your control.

00:50:11.760 --> 00:50:15.440
Whatever is in your
control is your ascent. You just ascend,

00:50:15.440 --> 00:50:17.640
that’s all. Nothing can touch you.

00:50:17.640 --> 00:50:19.200
You know, even if you are ascent…

00:50:19.200 --> 00:50:23.748
But in what sense could I ascend
so that it will not happen again?

00:50:23.748 --> 00:50:26.080
It will not affect you.
Then it will not affect you.

00:50:26.080 --> 00:50:28.640
If you are a saint, it won’t affect you.

00:50:28.640 --> 00:50:34.640
You know, we have experimented with that,
already they are trying. But we have tried

00:50:34.640 --> 00:50:37.400
experiments with this acid, acid rain…

00:50:37.400 --> 00:50:38.480
Acid rain?

00:50:38.480 --> 00:50:43.920
Acid rain in Austria. Acid rain, you know,
which destroys these trees.

00:50:47.840 --> 00:50:53.200
So, what we have found out that old
trees above sixty-years are no good.

00:50:53.200 --> 00:50:57.200
But below that, we put vibrated water.
You see,

00:50:57.200 --> 00:51:00.160
we vibrate the water with certain mantras
and something.

00:51:00.160 --> 00:51:05.760
Then that vibrated water we put there,
on these trees, which were… all of them.

00:51:05.760 --> 00:51:09.360
So, what we found out
that those were twenty-five-year-old

00:51:09.360 --> 00:51:12.240
or fifty-year-old reacted very well.

00:51:12.240 --> 00:51:15.520
Twenty-five-year-old are
absolutely fresh now.

00:51:15.520 --> 00:51:19.840
But those were above sixty to a
hundred became rather difficult.

00:51:19.840 --> 00:51:23.040
But above eighty they
were absolutely useless. So,

00:51:23.040 --> 00:51:25.920
the practical thing
would be to cut them out,

00:51:25.920 --> 00:51:32.640
use the timber if you want to,
and plant new trees. With vibrations.

00:51:32.640 --> 00:51:34.960
Isn’t that some kind of witchcraft?

00:51:34.960 --> 00:51:38.160
No, no, it is divine. It is the Divine.
You see,

00:51:38.160 --> 00:51:41.200
the Divine starts flowing through you
like a cool breeze, you see.

00:51:41.200 --> 00:51:43.360
The cool breeze of the Holy Ghost.

00:51:43.360 --> 00:51:46.800
You just have to put that, your hands,
once you are Realized,

00:51:46.800 --> 00:51:50.160
you can put in the water,
it gets vibrated.

00:51:50.160 --> 00:51:53.280
And you put it to those things, it grows.

00:51:53.280 --> 00:51:57.600
We have experimented in
university in Rahuri,

00:51:57.600 --> 00:52:00.000
which is an agricultural university.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:02.960
The results were amazingly great.

00:52:02.960 --> 00:52:06.720
Even this Austrian fellow,
who was a UN advisor,

00:52:06.720 --> 00:52:12.320
has experimented that he says,
“Ten times more they grow “.

00:52:12.320 --> 00:52:13.280
Just your hands.

00:52:13.280 --> 00:52:20.640
Yes, I mean this Findhorn,
you know about this community in England?

00:52:20.640 --> 00:52:25.440
Findhorn, people from all over the world,
spiritual people gather there, live there.

00:52:25.440 --> 00:52:30.160
And the plants,
the whole gardening increased like mad.

00:52:30.160 --> 00:52:32.311
It grew… it was beautiful.

00:52:32.311 --> 00:52:36.080
Must be. If they are truly spiritual,
it should. If they are truly spiritual,

00:52:36.080 --> 00:52:40.640
it should, but if they are not, you see,
if the majority are spiritual

00:52:40.640 --> 00:52:43.760
or there’s one powerful man there, it may.

00:52:43.760 --> 00:52:46.720
But it has to be someone there.
May not be all of them,

00:52:46.720 --> 00:52:49.440
may not be spiritual,
because there are many self-certified

00:52:49.440 --> 00:52:51.280
spiritual people these days.

00:52:51.280 --> 00:52:54.800
But individually,
even one person can do it,

00:52:54.800 --> 00:52:56.160
if he is really spiritual.

00:52:56.160 --> 00:53:00.400
Like this is a Muslim gentleman from Iran,
who is a Dr. Hamid, you see.

00:53:00.400 --> 00:53:02.400
And he did it and he has proved it.

00:53:02.400 --> 00:53:05.280
And now we have got a land in India,
where we are going to

00:53:05.280 --> 00:53:07.600
experiment for the whole world.
You don’t have to use

00:53:07.600 --> 00:53:11.520
hybrid seeds now anymore,
hybrid seeds anymore.

00:53:11.520 --> 00:53:14.720
You can use ordinary seeds, vibrate it.
It behaves

00:53:14.720 --> 00:53:16.720
like much more than a hybrid seed.

00:53:16.720 --> 00:53:20.560
And you get a very good crop out of it.

00:53:20.560 --> 00:53:22.160
And it’s not dangerous to you.

00:53:22.160 --> 00:53:27.520
Hybrid is very dangerous. So,
we can put an end to all these things.

00:53:27.520 --> 00:53:35.680
So, you would say also that if I meditate
or follow the cool breeze,

00:53:35.680 --> 00:53:38.640
I would be protected against atomic…

00:53:38.640 --> 00:53:43.885
Of course, of course. Hundred per cent.

00:53:43.885 --> 00:53:45.920
Hundred per cent. Hundred per cent.
You can control all nature, everything.

00:53:45.920 --> 00:53:48.240
It’s very simple.
You have to a little grow more,

00:53:48.240 --> 00:53:49.040
that’s all.

00:53:49.040 --> 00:53:53.920
But still, we would have to close
down the atomic factories.

00:53:53.920 --> 00:53:55.120
That they will automatically.

00:53:55.120 --> 00:54:00.240
When it is useless, why will they use it?

00:54:00.240 --> 00:54:03.200
But in any case, it will close down,
don’t you worry.

00:54:03.200 --> 00:54:05.200
All these things come up and go away.

00:54:05.920 --> 00:54:13.600
They won’t stay. One more blast in America
will finish them off. It’s only temporary.

00:54:13.600 --> 00:54:15.680
It’s a temporary thing.
Why waste our lives?

00:54:15.680 --> 00:54:17.760
Yes, but you know,
you can also say the Second

00:54:17.760 --> 00:54:21.600
World War was temporary,
but still so many people suffered

00:54:21.600 --> 00:54:23.440
and it’s not…

00:54:23.440 --> 00:54:26.720
You see, I understand the Second
World War was a big,

00:54:26.720 --> 00:54:30.800
