because they were not so collective.

00:54:30.800 --> 00:54:33.600
You see, in those days,
there was a recession all over the world,

00:54:33.600 --> 00:54:39.280
you see. And this gentleman, Hitler,
he made use of that. So,

00:54:39.280 --> 00:54:41.440
