00:54:41.440 --> 00:54:43.760
They were not so collective.
You have to be collective.

00:54:43.760 --> 00:54:46.720
Once you are collective,
then there cannot be any more wars,

00:54:46.720 --> 00:54:49.360
because once you are collective,
how can you fight your nose?

00:54:49.360 --> 00:54:50.560
How can you fight your ears?

00:54:50.560 --> 00:54:52.480
You become one. That’s what…

00:54:52.480 --> 00:54:56.080
But the difference would be to
be collective with the cosmos,

00:54:56.080 --> 00:55:00.480
which I think is a beautiful idea,
but collective in the sense

00:55:00.480 --> 00:55:04.480
of a very narrow people.

00:55:04.480 --> 00:55:04.792
No, they become big
National business.

00:55:04.792 --> 00:55:08.160
No, no, they become big. You see,
narrow people will die out.

00:55:08.160 --> 00:55:12.960
Only the big people will
become in charge of everything.

00:55:12.960 --> 00:55:14.240
Very optimistic.

00:55:14.240 --> 00:55:16.400
Of course,
it is already predicted in India,

00:55:16.400 --> 00:55:18.080
