00:55:18.080 --> 00:55:21.440
Well, I think here as well,
but maybe we read the wrong books.

00:55:21.440 --> 00:55:25.840
No, no, no.
So many of these have come true.

00:55:25.840 --> 00:55:29.115
They have predicted about Sahaja Yoga,
everything. So it’s coming true.

00:55:29.115 --> 00:55:31.115
Yes, in the Bible, I guess,
I think it’s also…

00:55:31.115 --> 00:55:35.200
Yes, in the Bible, anywhere. Even, even,
recently, a hundred years back,

00:55:35.200 --> 00:55:39.040
William Blake. This Lewis was about,
I think, sixty, seventy years back,

00:55:39.040 --> 00:55:41.200
he has predicting everything.

00:55:41.200 --> 00:55:43.200
So they are seers, they have seen it.

00:55:44.000 --> 00:55:46.720
Why will they tell us lies?
And it’s working out.

00:55:46.720 --> 00:55:49.040
Sahaja Yoga is working out,
whatever it is.

00:55:49.040 --> 00:55:53.760
Maybe in Germany rather slow, but you see,
all heavy things are difficult to move.

00:55:53.760 --> 00:55:56.400
But once they move, they move, you see.

00:55:56.400 --> 00:55:57.280
That’s the point.

00:55:57.280 --> 00:56:00.880
Yes, then they might go very fast
when they just once start…

00:56:00.880 --> 00:56:03.800
Yes, you see, that’s it!
That’s what I’m saying.

00:56:03.800 --> 00:56:07.680
And this is the point
which looks contradictory, but is not!

00:56:09.360 --> 00:56:14.240
What would you say is, actually,
the female quality

00:56:14.240 --> 00:56:17.920
