What is…

00:56:17.920 --> 00:56:21.760
The female quality is bearing power.

00:56:21.760 --> 00:56:22.960
Bearing power?

00:56:22.960 --> 00:56:29.760
Bearing. You see…

00:56:31.600 --> 00:56:33.920
Women are very powerful things.

00:56:33.920 --> 00:56:37.520
They can bear up lots of things, absorb.

00:56:38.240 --> 00:56:41.360
So many things they can
absorb in themselves. You see,

00:56:41.360 --> 00:56:45.280
they can finish all the
poison of the world. They can.

00:56:45.280 --> 00:56:48.560
They have such a capacity to absorb.

00:56:48.560 --> 00:56:53.040
But once you give up that quality,
then you become a…

00:56:53.040 --> 00:56:55.920
