00:57:02.560 --> 00:57:06.720
The bearing power, like you see now,
see in my family. For example,

00:57:06.720 --> 00:57:10.960
if there’s a calamity,
everybody will go haywire.

00:57:10.960 --> 00:57:13.760
My husband might faint and this thing.

00:57:13.760 --> 00:57:16.640
But I’ll stand up at that time.

00:57:17.600 --> 00:57:21.760
I would be the one who will show all the
power at that time to overcome

00:57:21.760 --> 00:57:25.520
that calamity. Any calamity will come.

00:57:25.520 --> 00:57:31.520
This woman shows her power at
that time of her steadfastness, her peace,

00:57:31.520 --> 00:57:33.600
her compassion, her optimism.

00:57:33.600 --> 00:57:36.080
Everything will bring forth again.

00:57:36.080 --> 00:57:38.240
That’s the capacity of the Mother Earth.
You see,

00:57:38.240 --> 00:57:41.840
supposing there’s a big wind comes in and
something disastrous

00:57:41.840 --> 00:57:44.880
happens to the nature,
the Mother Earth bears it up.

00:57:44.880 --> 00:57:48.880
Again she produces. That’s how,
like the Mother Earth.

00:57:48.880 --> 00:57:51.280
The capacity of a woman is
like the Mother Earth.

00:57:51.280 --> 00:57:55.440
She can always go on producing. Now see,
your Germany is full of

00:57:55.440 --> 00:57:59.440
these beautiful things.
Whether you deserve it or not,

00:57:59.440 --> 00:58:00.960
she gives you.

00:58:02.720 --> 00:58:07.680
Forgiveness, compassion, beautifying.

00:58:07.680 --> 00:58:10.640
A good woman will beautify
her house very nice.

00:58:10.640 --> 00:58:14.320
She’ll beautify the children.
She’ll try to give joy,

00:58:14.320 --> 00:58:17.200
fragrance to others all the time.

00:58:17.200 --> 00:58:20.720
And it’s such a big capacity.

00:58:20.720 --> 00:58:25.280
Men can entertain artificially,
but women genuinely do.

00:58:25.280 --> 00:58:30.640
Even if they don’t speak, they do.

00:58:30.640 --> 00:58:35.600
The clinging comes from that love,
that affection. You see, I’m surprised,

00:58:35.600 --> 00:58:39.680
in India, supposing, you see,
a lady is there.

00:58:39.680 --> 00:58:43.120
Everybody will go and see her,
meet her in the family, this thing,

00:58:43.120 --> 00:58:46.960
that thing. The husband is there,
then nobody will be there.

00:58:47.600 --> 00:58:49.840
Supposing the husband
is staying in the house. Now in my house,

00:58:49.840 --> 00:58:54.640
nobody will visit,
unless and until I am there. He says,

00:58:54.640 --> 00:59:00.560
“I have no friends,
only I get bills from everywhere.

00:59:00.560 --> 00:59:03.600
And you get all the love
letters from everyone.

00:59:03.600 --> 00:59:06.320
Everyone writes to you
such loving letters. All the daughters,

00:59:06.320 --> 00:59:09.200
everyone writes to you. And to me,
they just send bills and demands”.

00:59:09.200 --> 00:59:11.680
“You see, I said, you are a man”. So,
he said,

00:59:12.400 --> 00:59:13.920
“Next life I should try to be a woman.

00:59:13.920 --> 00:59:18.320
I said, “You cannot now.
It’s finished for you”.

00:59:18.320 --> 00:59:20.080
Men are jealous of women in India.

00:59:20.080 --> 00:59:24.880
It’s the other way round here.
Everything upside down.

00:59:24.880 --> 00:59:27.760
Maybe some men are jealous here too.

00:59:27.760 --> 00:59:35.840
I think sometimes. I had to… Oh yeah,
did you yourself have a master once?

00:59:35.840 --> 00:59:36.160
No.

00:59:36.160 --> 00:59:38.240
No, never.

00:59:38.240 --> 00:59:40.720
I went to see all of them.
I met all of them.

00:59:40.720 --> 00:59:42.320
I wanted to see what they are doing.

00:59:42.320 --> 00:59:45.520
So I said, all right. They said,
“We’ll be your master”. I said,

00:59:45.520 --> 00:59:46.720
“All right, you’ll be my master.

00:59:46.720 --> 00:59:49.680
Let’s see what is it”. You see,
this is another quality of a woman,

00:59:49.680 --> 00:59:53.600
is illusion.
She can create illusions about things

00:59:53.600 --> 00:59:57.440
and she can work out very well
in an elusive capacity. So,

00:59:57.440 --> 00:59:59.360
I wanted to find out what
these people are up to,

00:59:59.360 --> 01:00:04.960
and I found them out. They are hypocrites,
money-oriented and trickery.

01:00:04.960 --> 01:00:05.840
All are.

01:00:05.840 --> 01:00:08.800
Most of these gurus, so-called,
who came here.

01:00:08.800 --> 01:00:12.160
Oh, yes.
Do you think there is one who is really…

01:00:12.160 --> 01:00:13.913
Oh, there are many in India.

01:00:13.913 --> 01:00:14.960
Who is really very high?

01:00:14.960 --> 01:00:16.720
Oh yes, there are many in India.

01:00:16.720 --> 01:00:18.000
Could you give me a name?

01:00:18.640 --> 01:00:23.200
He’s a…
We can say Sainath who lived in Shirdi.

01:00:23.200 --> 01:00:26.000
Sainath was a great saint
who is no more now.

01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:28.480
But there are many saints
like this one called…

01:00:28.480 --> 01:00:30.880
But they live in obscure conditions,
you see.

01:00:30.880 --> 01:00:35.200
They don’t have my capacity to come out
and talk to people. They say,

01:00:35.200 --> 01:00:39.520
“You are a mother, all right. You do this,
your job. We cannot”. Some say,

01:00:39.520 --> 01:00:40.720
“We’ll come after 12 years”.

01:00:40.720 --> 01:00:42.320
They are hiding, in the hiding.

01:00:42.320 --> 01:00:43.520
They don’t want to meet anyone.

01:00:43.520 --> 01:00:45.120
They are all the time in the hiding.

01:00:45.120 --> 01:00:49.200
Because men are beaten up easily, you see,
when they come out, they say anything,

01:00:49.200 --> 01:00:50.400
they are tortured.

01:00:50.400 --> 01:00:52.480
So they want to hide themselves mostly.

01:00:52.480 --> 01:00:54.320
We have so many in India.

01:00:54.320 --> 01:00:56.080
Did you know Kirpal Singh?

01:00:56.080 --> 01:00:56.720
Who?

01:00:56.720 --> 01:00:57.920
Kirpal Singh.

01:00:57.920 --> 01:00:58.240
Oh!

01:00:58.240 --> 01:01:00.880
Horrible.

01:01:00.880 --> 01:01:02.480
Horrible?

01:01:02.480 --> 01:01:08.800
He causes heart attacks.
All his disciples who have come

01:01:08.800 --> 01:01:12.000
to Me have terrible heart attacks.

01:01:12.000 --> 01:01:14.560
I don’t know what he does.
And now the new fellow

01:01:14.560 --> 01:01:17.360
that he has appointed doesn’t even talk,
nothing.

01:01:17.360 --> 01:01:23.520
He sits on a height and only there is big,
big… Because I know him as it is.

01:01:23.520 --> 01:01:27.600
You can see it from there. Big,
big boxes kept there. When you go to him,

01:01:27.600 --> 01:01:31.280
you see, for the darshan,
you must put some money in those boxes.

01:01:31.280 --> 01:01:36.080
They have amassed money.
This Kirpal Singh is dead.

01:01:36.080 --> 01:01:38.000
And this another fellow
is good for nothing.

01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:39.280
They always get heart attacks.

01:01:39.280 --> 01:01:42.560
All his disciples have heart problems.

01:01:42.560 --> 01:01:46.400
I don’t know what he does.
He gives names to people.

01:01:46.400 --> 01:01:50.240
You take this mantra haphazard.
He has no sense at all.

01:01:50.240 --> 01:01:57.120
He doesn’t give mantras to somebody,
like it’s a country doctor

01:01:57.120 --> 01:01:59.040
who doesn’t know anything to what to give.

01:01:59.040 --> 01:02:01.440
He goes on giving mantras.

01:02:01.440 --> 01:02:05.680
It’s more a liaison office, you see,
where all the ministers go,

01:02:05.680 --> 01:02:09.920
everybody goes there
and have a good way of meeting each other.

01:02:09.920 --> 01:02:14.000
Because if the ministers in India
meet somebody in the open places,

01:02:14.000 --> 01:02:18.080
or in the public places,
they’ll be regarded as corrupt.

01:02:18.080 --> 01:02:24.240
So they go to these particular places
or to races, some places like that,

01:02:24.240 --> 01:02:28.640
where they could do the corrupt work and
have meetings with people for corruption.

01:02:28.640 --> 01:02:33.680
It’s more a liaison office for people.
It is like that.

01:02:35.120 --> 01:02:40.960
I haven’t seen one person from him
who got Realization or who is peaceful,

01:02:40.960 --> 01:02:44.160
who is devoid of money orientation.

01:02:44.160 --> 01:02:48.880
Some of his disciples in Saigon
or something, no in Jakarta,

01:02:48.880 --> 01:02:53.680
were all arrested for smuggling.
And they met Me in …

01:02:53.680 --> 01:02:57.120
I mean their relations
met Me in Singapore. And they told that,

01:02:57.120 --> 01:03:00.800
“They are all in jail.
And we followed this guru

01:03:00.800 --> 01:03:03.520
and most of the money,
whatever we used to earn,

01:03:03.520 --> 01:03:04.720
we used to send him.

01:03:04.720 --> 01:03:07.360
So why should God be unkind?” I said,
“There must be something

01:03:07.360 --> 01:03:09.520
wrong with your guru. And where is he?”

01:03:09.520 --> 01:03:12.000
“He’s gone to Switzerland”.

01:03:12.000 --> 01:03:14.560
Oh, but that’s somebody else, I think.
It’s not…

01:03:14.560 --> 01:03:19.440
Same fellow.
Karpal Singh is the same fellow.

01:03:19.440 --> 01:03:24.000
His name is Radhaswami.
He calls it Radhaswami.

01:03:24.000 --> 01:03:26.240
I don’t know why he
calls himself Radhaswami.

01:03:26.240 --> 01:03:31.840
This is another mystery to Me.

01:03:31.840 --> 01:03:38.160
You see, because of our heritage,
I tell you in India,

01:03:38.160 --> 01:03:44.000
because of our heritage,
we know lots of things, how to talk big.

01:03:44.000 --> 01:03:48.160
We can talk big, you see. In India,
we have a great heritage.

01:03:48.160 --> 01:03:53.440
We could be hypocrites, we could talk big,
we can cheat people very easily because,

01:03:53.440 --> 01:03:57.440
you see,
we have so many things in our country,

01:03:57.440 --> 01:04:00.720
such a heritage we have. So,
we know how to do all these

01:04:00.720 --> 01:04:04.320
things to cheat others, if we want to.

01:04:04.320 --> 01:04:08.480
Because if you talk big, you see,
naturally, how will you know?

01:04:08.480 --> 01:04:12.000
Because so many people said that, “Mother,
if he’s so dishonest,

01:04:12.000 --> 01:04:13.720
how does he say such a such thing?

01:04:13.720 --> 01:04:16.400
” I said, “What is that?
Just to lift your tongue

01:04:16.400 --> 01:04:19.280
and say something for a man like that?

01:04:19.280 --> 01:04:21.280
Does he? He has no background, nothing.

01:04:21.280 --> 01:04:25.120
What are their bona fides ? Nothing.

01:04:25.120 --> 01:04:27.600
What are their bona fides?
From where they come?

01:04:27.600 --> 01:04:30.000
What is their family background?

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:32.560
Just find out. You’ll be surprised.

01:04:32.560 --> 01:04:42.480
Some of them are coming direct from jail.

01:04:42.480 --> 01:04:44.800
This is it.
And then in their private life,

01:04:44.800 --> 01:04:48.560
you should see how they live,
how they behave. Nobody knows about

01:04:48.560 --> 01:04:50.800
their private life also.

01:04:50.800 --> 01:04:55.360
Such a secretive thing. So, like this,
everyone knows about Me, every bit of Me,

01:04:55.920 --> 01:04:58.640
whatever money they collect they know,
whatever they spend they know,

01:04:58.640 --> 01:05:00.400
everything is known to everyone.

01:05:00.960 --> 01:05:05.360
Everything is open. My boxes are open,
everything open to them.

01:05:05.360 --> 01:05:08.800
What was the most terrible thing
that ever happened to you,

01:05:08.800 --> 01:05:11.760
where you really didn’t
know what to do anymore?

01:05:11.760 --> 01:05:17.920
Did you have such an event or time?

01:05:17.920 --> 01:05:23.200
No, I witness it as a drama,
so anything that happens is a drama to Me,

01:05:23.200 --> 01:05:27.200
just a drama, a play.
I don’t think I have seen,

01:05:27.200 --> 01:05:31.360
I remember of anything
that has happened like that, really,

01:05:31.360 --> 01:05:33.280
nothing so far.

01:05:33.280 --> 01:05:34.080
Not?

01:05:34.080 --> 01:05:35.840
No, I don’t think like that.

01:05:35.840 --> 01:05:39.040
Because, I mean, sometimes a child dies
or something like that.

01:05:39.040 --> 01:05:41.880
A child dies, yes, I did see that also,
I saw a child…

01:05:41.880 --> 01:05:43.200
No, but your own child. Something…

01:05:43.200 --> 01:05:44.320
My grandchild died.

01:05:44.320 --> 01:05:46.560
Really infected your stability.

01:05:46.560 --> 01:05:49.120
No, no, no, it did not.
Nothing disturbed Me.

01:05:49.120 --> 01:05:54.800
Because I am in a witness state. So,
I just witness it. Like a spectator it is.

01:05:54.800 --> 01:06:00.000
Of course, I saw it and also, you see,
many a times when…

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:03.120
now supposing I have to leave Munich,
and my children here,

01:06:03.120 --> 01:06:06.000
so maybe some tears might
drop out of my eyes, maybe.

01:06:06.000 --> 01:06:07.040
Oh, they live here?

01:06:07.040 --> 01:06:09.840
Some of them. Some of them. My children,
these are all my children,

01:06:09.840 --> 01:06:11.740
these are my children.

01:06:11.740 --> 01:06:11.760
Your disciples, yes.

01:06:11.760 --> 01:06:16.160
Yes, they are here,
so I may feel sad for them. That’s all.

01:06:16.160 --> 01:06:21.120
Sometimes with concern this happens,
but never a disaster in my life.

01:06:21.120 --> 01:06:27.840
I have always witnessed it.
It has not affected Me. Yes.

01:06:27.840 --> 01:06:30.240
Well, I think that’s…

01:06:30.240 --> 01:06:34.000
That’s the bearing capacity,
what you said was abstract. You see,

01:06:34.000 --> 01:06:38.880
you can see in Me that practical thing,
it’s so. I don’t have that problem at all.

01:06:38.880 --> 01:06:42.080
I don’t bother.
There’s so many things have to happen,

01:06:42.080 --> 01:06:44.800
you know,
because I criticize all these gurus

01:06:44.800 --> 01:06:49.040
who have money. You see, they try,
arrange this, that, against Me,

01:06:49.040 --> 01:06:52.800
and they try to buy people,
do all sorts of tricks, you see.

01:06:52.800 --> 01:06:56.640
Never face Me directly. So,
it’s all right. That’s a part of the game.

01:06:56.640 --> 01:06:59.680
It all right, doesn’t matter. To Me,
it doesn’t matter.

01:06:59.680 --> 01:07:03.520
These people do get upset,
like one lady started

01:07:03.520 --> 01:07:07.440
hitting Me with a Bible.
They all were very upset,

01:07:07.440 --> 01:07:11.920
and I was just laughing at this woman,
imagine! She came with a Bible to hit Me.

01:07:11.920 --> 01:07:15.200
I said,
“She couldn’t get anything else better? “

01:07:15.200 --> 01:07:16.720
What a joke, I thought.

01:07:16.720 --> 01:07:19.600
But they were very upset, all of them.
You were there?

01:07:19.600 --> 01:07:19.920
No.

01:07:19.920 --> 01:07:21.040
No, he was not there.

01:07:21.040 --> 01:07:25.600
So, you think the whole maya
life is a big drama of Maya.

01:07:25.600 --> 01:07:27.840
It’s just a maya, it’s a joke, you see.

01:07:27.840 --> 01:07:31.680
And there is the internal power
that is working it out, you see, this way,

01:07:31.680 --> 01:07:35.120
that way, showing you, this is this,
this is this, this is this. Those

01:07:35.120 --> 01:07:37.200
who have pure intelligence should see.

01:07:37.200 --> 01:07:41.040
They should not adhere themselves
to one place or to another. Like, you see,

01:07:41.040 --> 01:07:42.800
somebody gets attached to a guru.

01:07:42.800 --> 01:07:47.920
Then he doesn’t want to think about it,
what good it has done.

01:07:47.920 --> 01:07:50.880
That’s a simple thing as that.
That’s pure intelligence,

01:07:50.880 --> 01:07:52.960
it should be there.
If you have pure intelligence,

01:07:52.960 --> 01:07:54.880
you can see through these things.

01:07:54.880 --> 01:08:03.360
And what is it for? For your benevolence,
isn’t it? Why should we adhere to anyone?

01:08:03.360 --> 01:08:06.080
Because it suits us, we’ve been there.

01:08:06.080 --> 01:08:09.600
But supposing I say,
“Your diamond is lost”, all right?

01:08:09.600 --> 01:08:13.520
Your diamond is lost. You are seeing here,
there, there, there. You didn’t find it.

01:08:13.520 --> 01:08:16.160
It is here. Will you not take it?

01:08:16.160 --> 01:08:17.200
Will you not?

01:08:17.200 --> 01:08:20.480
Will you not take that diamond?
Because you have been

01:08:20.480 --> 01:08:21.840
searching there still,
you will go on searching.

01:08:21.840 --> 01:08:27.280
But maybe I don’t see it. Maybe,
even though it’s there, I don’t see it.

01:08:27.280 --> 01:08:28.080
Maybe I’m blind.

01:08:28.080 --> 01:08:31.120
Because you develop a
habit of guru shopping. Supposing,

01:08:31.120 --> 01:08:34.480
if you develop a habit of guru shopping
or depending on somebody

01:08:34.480 --> 01:08:38.000
– people like some gurus
because they don’t give you anything,

01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:43.520
so they feel very happy that you can
give them money and be satisfied.

01:08:43.520 --> 01:08:47.200
That’s all. They don’t want to get
anything out of them.

01:08:47.200 --> 01:08:49.200
Such people would not be called
as seekers,

01:08:49.200 --> 01:08:53.120
if those who are seekers must have…
I would say,

01:08:53.120 --> 01:09:01.120
top class seekers must have a temperament
which I would say is pure,

01:09:01.120 --> 01:09:04.400
pure temperament. In a pure glass,
you can see things,

01:09:04.400 --> 01:09:07.520
pure mirror you can see. It’s like that.

01:09:07.520 --> 01:09:10.139
It should be purity. So whatever is,
“Not this, not this, not this”,

01:09:10.139 --> 01:09:10.233
it’s a Sanskrit and “Ya neti neti vachane,
nigamor avochus”. By saying, “Neti, neti”,

01:09:10.233 --> 01:09:21.840
“Not this, not this,
not this” you reach the point.

01:09:21.840 --> 01:09:26.000
But if you have a habit of guru shopping,
then it’s a habit.

01:09:26.000 --> 01:09:33.760
It’s a kind of a pastime, you should say,
pastime, entertainment. It’s not.

01:09:33.760 --> 01:09:37.360
It’s something to be achieved,
you have to be consulted . After all,

01:09:37.360 --> 01:09:39.400
life should not be waited on these things.

01:09:39.400 --> 01:09:42.320
It’s very precious. That’s it.

01:09:42.320 --> 01:09:46.800
If you don’t want, if you don’t understand
the preciousness of life,

01:09:46.800 --> 01:09:50.320
the importance of life, the depth of it…
of course,

01:09:50.320 --> 01:09:52.320
you have to be profound about it.

01:09:52.320 --> 01:09:56.880
Then I am sure, I have a feeling
that Germans are very profound people.

01:09:56.880 --> 01:10:03.680
They take to superficial things, no doubt,
little bit, as they do,

01:10:03.680 --> 01:10:07.440
and to ego pampering also.
But a day will come

01:10:07.440 --> 01:10:12.080
when they will realize. They will realize
but it should not be late,

01:10:12.080 --> 01:10:15.680
because they are the last in Sahaja Yoga.

01:10:15.680 --> 01:10:17.840
Last, now, I would say, isn’t it?

01:10:17.840 --> 01:10:21.337
What would you say? Even we have in…

01:10:21.337 --> 01:10:21.360
They are the last in…

01:10:21.360 --> 01:10:27.040
Yes, yes, yes. In Sierra Leone,
we have maximum number, compared to here.

01:10:27.040 --> 01:10:31.240
I mean much more, Sierra Leone,
what is it? So far-fetched a place where…

01:10:31.240 --> 01:10:32.160
It’s in Africa.

01:10:32.160 --> 01:10:32.560
yes.

01:10:32.560 --> 01:10:36.560
In Africa! And some people went down
there from Australia,

01:10:36.560 --> 01:10:41.600
and they got so many people.
Just like that! So,

01:10:41.600 --> 01:10:47.360
it is rather difficult to say.
Just let’s hope.

01:10:47.360 --> 01:10:52.800
To me it looks as
if a lot of people actually are doing some

01:10:52.800 --> 01:10:58.787
kind of spiritual searching
and also work here in Germany.

01:10:58.787 --> 01:11:00.960
You see, but all that is ego pampering.

01:11:00.960 --> 01:11:02.960
You see, ego pampering is more there.

01:11:02.960 --> 01:11:04.960
You see, it is not egoless-ness.

01:11:04.960 --> 01:11:10.720
It’s more ego pampering. One has to see,
what have we gained? In all humility.

01:11:10.720 --> 01:11:13.680
You see, searching for searching’s
sake is nonsense, isn’t it?

01:11:14.240 --> 01:11:16.720
