01:26:33.840 --> 01:26:35.360
when you shook hands with Me.

01:26:35.360 --> 01:26:37.000
I could feel. I said, “That’s all right “.

01:26:37.000 --> 01:26:40.320
But still I told them,
“Just have a look at her”. I mean,

01:26:40.320 --> 01:26:45.040
but it’s nice. You talked of subjects
which are concerning modern problems.

01:26:45.040 --> 01:26:47.680
And it has to be dealt
with from spiritual angle.

01:26:47.680 --> 01:26:51.200
It’s all integrated.
It is not somewhere separate.

01:26:51.200 --> 01:26:55.680
If we all get transformed,
all problems will be solved.

01:26:55.680 --> 01:27:00.400
Automatically.
They have no problems of any kind.

01:27:00.400 --> 01:27:01.440
Absolutely not.

01:27:01.440 --> 01:27:01.920
No?

01:27:01.920 --> 01:27:02.880
No problems.

01:27:02.880 --> 01:27:05.440
They have only one problem,
how to spread Sahaja Yoga.

01:27:05.440 --> 01:27:11.440
Yes. We are getting slowly in
the witness stage also.

01:27:11.440 --> 01:27:16.000
Yes, yes, very much so.

01:27:16.000 --> 01:27:23.120
By the way, that’s my training also
for some time already. Yes. And it’s,

01:27:23.120 --> 01:27:27.360
somehow,
it’s extremely interesting to know.

01:27:27.360 --> 01:27:33.760
I started to work with the public
society only half a year now.

01:27:33.760 --> 01:27:39.760
Before I kept very quiet
away from everything. Because I had to,

01:27:39.760 --> 01:27:45.680
after a very working, successful life,
I had to go into myself for a long time,

01:27:45.680 --> 01:27:49.400
five years.
And now I’m back again in the big market.

01:27:49.400 --> 01:27:49.840
Yes.

01:27:49.840 --> 01:27:50.560
And it’s very…

01:27:50.560 --> 01:27:52.720
And you should become dynamic now.
You become dynamic,

01:27:52.720 --> 01:27:55.760
because you’ll be helped by God. You know,
God’s helps are such,

01:27:55.760 --> 01:27:58.480
suddenly you get things,
you are amazed how you get it.

01:27:58.480 --> 01:28:02.160
Yes, but still it takes, it seems to me,
it takes a lot of time to,

01:28:02.160 --> 01:28:04.480
to bring the two things together.

01:28:04.480 --> 01:28:07.920
No, no, no. Not for God.
Now He’s standing on your

01:28:07.920 --> 01:28:10.400
head wherever you go.

01:28:10.400 --> 01:28:12.480
Not for Him. Maybe for you.

01:28:12.480 --> 01:28:13.595
Well, for me it is.

01:28:13.595 --> 01:28:17.280
Yes, you will see that. Every moment,
every moment you will see

01:28:17.280 --> 01:28:18.880
now He’s holding your hand.

01:28:18.880 --> 01:28:24.560
You’ll see that. Not for Him.
It’s for you.

01:28:24.560 --> 01:28:29.200
Just He’s along there
with you all the time. Just remember that.

01:28:29.200 --> 01:28:31.120
He’s all the time there. He’s there now.

01:28:31.120 --> 01:28:34.880
He’s fixed up with you.
Now don’t you worry.

01:28:34.880 --> 01:28:38.800
You may not feel Him in the beginning,
but you will see it. You’ll see, Sahaj,

01:28:38.800 --> 01:28:44.000
spontaneously, by chance, “How can it be?

01:28:44.000 --> 01:28:53.360
It’s not possible. How it has worked out?”

01:28:53.360 --> 01:28:57.360
Very surprising things happen.

01:28:57.360 --> 01:29:02.960
They bought a house in London
for some sort of a work.

01:29:02.960 --> 01:29:09.600
And they wanted to go to ask for
some permission for the extension. So,

01:29:09.600 --> 01:29:12.000
the owner said, “Oh,
they are very difficult people.

01:29:12.000 --> 01:29:13.120
You don’t know these people.

01:29:13.120 --> 01:29:15.360
They’ll not allow to do even this much.

01:29:15.360 --> 01:29:18.640
You can’t move even one inch, this, that”.

01:29:18.640 --> 01:29:22.800
I said, “You go and see them. So first,
give them a bandhan”. You see,

01:29:22.800 --> 01:29:24.720
this is the love pouring from our hand.

01:29:24.720 --> 01:29:27.920
We just give a bandhan like that.

01:29:27.920 --> 01:29:30.320
And they were so happy to see.

01:29:30.320 --> 01:29:32.400
And that we want to develop it and all.

01:29:32.400 --> 01:29:35.440
“Oh, wonderful. We’ll do everything”.
On the contrary,

01:29:35.440 --> 01:29:39.520
they suggested so many things. So,
they came back. They said, “Mother,

01:29:39.520 --> 01:29:43.200
on the contrary,
they suggested things like that”. So,

01:29:43.200 --> 01:29:45.760
I think this man must be something madcap,
you see.

01:29:45.760 --> 01:29:47.680
Must be trying to do something mad.

01:29:47.680 --> 01:29:49.440
But they have suggested,
so it all worked out.

01:29:49.440 --> 01:29:57.320
So, all worked out on material level.

01:29:57.320 --> 01:30:00.240
Leave alone everything,
on material level it works.

01:30:00.240 --> 01:30:03.280
Yes. No,
I don’t worry about this material level.

01:30:03.280 --> 01:30:08.960
It just works out, just works out.

01:30:13.200 --> 01:30:17.120
She’s not thinking.
She’s beyond thinking now.

01:30:17.120 --> 01:30:18.160
I’m not thinking yes.

01:30:18.160 --> 01:30:26.320
You cannot. You’ve gone beyond thinking.

01:30:26.320 --> 01:30:29.120
The heat energy is released
through a hole here, you see.

01:30:29.120 --> 01:30:33.360
It’s coming out.

01:30:33.360 --> 01:30:38.560
Because her eyes are becoming
so beautiful.

01:30:38.560 --> 01:30:40.000
There’s a glisten in the eye, you see.

01:30:40.000 --> 01:30:46.880
There’s a, like a light, it comes out.

01:30:46.880 --> 01:30:48.560
Time has to come for everything.

01:30:48.560 --> 01:30:51.120
But it’s true, isn’t it? Even for Germany.

01:30:51.120 --> 01:30:55.600
I used to tell you always,
time has to come. It has to come, you see.

01:30:55.600 --> 01:30:57.760
And she said that,
“They have to go through all

01:30:57.760 --> 01:31:00.480
this to learn a lesson “. Maybe.

01:31:00.480 --> 01:31:05.360
Maybe the time has to come, yes.

01:31:10.800 --> 01:31:15.200
And it’s very nice in modern time,
because cruelty becomes so obvious,

01:31:15.200 --> 01:31:21.360
you see, like fanaticism. So obvious,
you see. Cruelty of people, so obvious.

01:31:21.360 --> 01:31:24.080
You can see the difference
between the good and the bad, you see,

01:31:24.080 --> 01:31:26.560
that these are horrible people.

01:31:26.560 --> 01:31:31.200
Yes, the young people,
they see it already. So clear.

01:31:31.200 --> 01:31:35.280
Young people are really suffering,
you know. They are such idealists.

01:31:35.280 --> 01:31:37.680
And for them I have come to the West.

01:31:37.680 --> 01:31:40.480
I think they are such beautiful things.

01:31:40.480 --> 01:31:44.480
I really weep for them,
really weep for them.

01:31:44.480 --> 01:31:46.560
I feel so much for them.

01:31:46.560 --> 01:31:50.880
They are so genuine good people.

01:31:50.880 --> 01:31:56.400
Very nice they are. They suffer a lot.

01:31:56.400 --> 01:31:59.600
First,
I worked with the hippies to begin with.

01:31:59.600 --> 01:32:05.840
And I’ve always seen
that they were seekers, very much.

01:32:05.840 --> 01:32:07.680
Young people suffer a lot.

01:32:07.680 --> 01:32:09.920
Were they hippies in India?

01:32:09.920 --> 01:32:11.520
In Ind-in London.

01:32:11.520 --> 01:32:12.240
In London.

01:32:12.240 --> 01:32:18.800
Yes, for…seven of them. For four years,
I worked on them to fix them up.

01:32:19.360 --> 01:32:22.240
Very difficult. But they were seekers.

01:32:22.240 --> 01:32:25.600
There were seekers, absolutely,
three of them were gone cases.

01:32:25.600 --> 01:32:28.640
One was like an absolute madman.

01:32:28.640 --> 01:32:33.120
He didn’t know how to connect
from one line to another. Another one was,

01:32:33.120 --> 01:32:34.800
when he came, he couldn’t even see Me.

01:32:34.800 --> 01:32:36.880
He was just seeing some
light shooting out of Me,

01:32:36.880 --> 01:32:41.600
sort of a half-dazed condition.

01:32:41.600 --> 01:32:46.480
The third girl, who was a French girl,
studied in universities.

01:32:46.480 --> 01:32:53.040
She was suffering from, what you can say,
kind of a coma, coma condition.

01:32:53.040 --> 01:32:58.320
It’s terrible.
They were the first who got the brand.

01:32:58.320 --> 01:33:00.800
And that’s what they
are trying to find out, new things,

01:33:00.800 --> 01:33:02.800
no doubt.

01:33:02.800 --> 01:33:06.240
I wrote a very nice poem for them
when I was going to America. I don’t know

01:33:06.240 --> 01:33:08.308
if it is here with you anywhere.

01:33:08.308 --> 01:33:10.960
Yes, Mother;
Give her. Let us see what my concern was.

01:33:10.960 --> 01:33:14.400
But they wouldn’t listen to Me
when I went first time. In ’73,

01:33:14.400 --> 01:33:18.560
when I went to America,
I wrote this poem on the ship.

01:33:18.560 --> 01:33:19.920
And it got lost somewhere.

01:33:19.920 --> 01:33:21.360
And I don’t know how they found it.

01:33:21.360 --> 01:33:27.680
I don’t know how they found it,
‘For the flower people’.

01:33:27.680 --> 01:33:29.680
But a very sweet poem for them.

01:33:29.680 --> 01:33:35.840
But they were lost already. In a sense,
you see, they were just on an ego trip,

01:33:35.840 --> 01:33:38.560
sort of.
Hippieism also become an ego trip,

01:33:38.560 --> 01:33:44.080
sort of a ego trip, you see. So,
they change their…

01:33:44.080 --> 01:33:46.960
The other side is, I think, the seeker.

01:33:46.960 --> 01:33:48.240
They are seekers.

01:33:48.240 --> 01:33:51.200
But they got into an ego trip, you see.
That’s what,

01:33:51.200 --> 01:33:53.280
because the method was not correct.

01:33:53.280 --> 01:33:56.080
You see, by becoming hippie,
you do not become…

01:33:56.080 --> 01:33:57.349
Also drugs.

01:33:57.349 --> 01:33:57.760
I beg your pardon?

01:33:57.760 --> 01:33:59.840
Also the drugs. Very difficult.

01:33:59.840 --> 01:34:00.560
Also the?

01:34:00.560 --> 01:34:02.400
The drugs.

01:34:02.400 --> 01:34:06.640
Terrible things drugs are.

01:34:06.640 --> 01:34:09.840
I mean, in India we grow it,
we never see it. We don’t know.

01:34:09.840 --> 01:34:11.520
I don’t know the drugs, what they are.

01:34:11.520 --> 01:34:14.400
I mean, they all are grown in India.
We don’t know.

01:34:14.400 --> 01:34:16.960
I can’t make out one from another.
We have never seen.

01:34:16.960 --> 01:34:23.120
My husband has never seen. So, I mean,
to us it is something absurd.

01:34:23.120 --> 01:34:24.880
That’s poison and not to be taken.

01:34:24.880 --> 01:34:27.840
That’s all. So, I don’t blame them.

01:34:27.840 --> 01:34:35.520
They didn’t have this knowledge. Very sad.

01:34:35.520 --> 01:34:43.280
Then this, another problem of sexual,
free sex, this, that. Very dangerous.

01:34:43.280 --> 01:34:47.200
And I told them ,
“Don’t go into all this experimentation.

01:34:47.200 --> 01:34:51.200
It will develop a disease,
a terrible disease”. So,

01:34:51.200 --> 01:34:54.400
when I went next time now,
they telephoned to Me, “Mother,

01:34:54.400 --> 01:34:57.440
we are already in it. You had told us”.

01:34:57.440 --> 01:35:01.440
Parapsychology, I told them,
“Don’t go into it”. That whole thing is

01:35:01.440 --> 01:35:06.800
absolutely finished now.

01:35:06.800 --> 01:35:10.800
But they didn’t like anybody telling
them not to do something at that time,

01:35:10.800 --> 01:35:13.200
you see. They liked only people who said,
“All right, go ahead.

01:35:13.200 --> 01:35:14.320
You want to have drugs, have it.

01:35:14.320 --> 01:35:16.560
Only give me the money”.

01:35:16.560 --> 01:35:20.320
You see these gurus, what they proclaimed,
that, “If you give us the money,

01:35:20.320 --> 01:35:23.040
you accept us as gurus,
we’ll take you to heaven”. You see,

01:35:23.040 --> 01:35:25.680
everybody is a sort of a chosen person.

01:35:25.680 --> 01:35:28.000
And so simple they were to believe.

01:35:28.000 --> 01:35:33.600
People are very simple here.
I would say naive in a way.

01:35:33.600 --> 01:35:36.800
How can you believe such a thing?

01:35:36.800 --> 01:35:42.000
I can’t understand. You tell Indians that,
“By taking drugs you’ll go to God”.

01:35:42.000 --> 01:35:45.680
They’ll say, “Tell me another, get out,
get lost”.

01:35:45.680 --> 01:35:49.600
Nobody would believe such a nonsense.

01:35:49.600 --> 01:35:51.360
We can never believe such a nonsense.

01:35:51.360 --> 01:35:54.240
Even a guru who comes and says,
“All right, I’ll give you this mantra”.

01:35:54.240 --> 01:35:57.840
They’ll say, “All right, get lost,
I know all that”. Nobody would believe

01:35:57.840 --> 01:36:02.400
such gurus also in India, stupid ones.

01:36:02.400 --> 01:36:04.480
Especially someone like Rajneesh. Oh!

01:36:04.480 --> 01:36:05.680
He had to get out of India.

01:36:05.680 --> 01:36:08.480
He didn’t have any Indian disciples.

01:36:08.480 --> 01:36:10.480
Only those who were thugs were with him.

01:36:10.480 --> 01:36:13.760
And they all ran away with his money
and everything.

01:36:13.760 --> 01:36:16.720
But now he’s finished.

01:36:16.720 --> 01:36:17.360
Yes.

01:36:17.360 --> 01:36:20.080
But he’s showing his results on the…

01:36:20.080 --> 01:36:27.520
you have seen the match between Uruguay
and the Scotland people, no? Oh Baba!

01:36:27.520 --> 01:36:30.320
They were just like devils,
these Uruguay people were.

01:36:30.320 --> 01:36:33.200
And when the Scotland people
are supposed to be very violent,

01:36:33.200 --> 01:36:38.240
they said, “It was the scum of football”,
isn’t it?

01:36:38.240 --> 01:36:39.120
Yes.

01:36:39.120 --> 01:36:40.880
Scum of football.

01:36:40.880 --> 01:36:48.000
Yes.

01:36:48.000 --> 01:36:54.521
Does something happen with the medallion?

01:36:54.521 --> 01:36:56.937
Now this is Shri Mataji, the medallion,
what you’re wearing.

01:36:56.937 --> 01:36:56.960
Oh! Yes, yes.
Oh. I see.

01:36:56.960 --> 01:37:01.600
That’s my photograph they wear.

01:37:01.600 --> 01:37:02.920
If they want to, they can.

01:37:02.920 --> 01:37:05.920
If they don’t want, they can. I mean,
there’s no compulsion of anything,

01:37:05.920 --> 01:37:09.671
but they like to. They love Me. So,
they want to…

01:37:09.671 --> 01:37:11.120
They are so young.

01:37:11.120 --> 01:37:12.480
Yes. He’s so young,

01:37:12.480 --> 01:37:15.040
But it helps a lot.

01:37:15.040 --> 01:37:18.480
But we have very young people also,
very young.

01:37:18.480 --> 01:37:22.000
We have one young fellow now who is,
what’s the age of Kevin?

01:37:22.000 --> 01:37:25.120
Would be 18 or 17?

01:37:25.120 --> 01:37:26.240
17.

01:37:26.240 --> 01:37:28.480
17, and he came to India this time.

01:37:28.480 --> 01:37:32.560
And I said, “Mother, get me a girlfriend,
you know, because in the school they

01:37:32.560 --> 01:37:36.160
all call me goody-goody, this, this,
‘You must have a girlfriend, girlfriend’.

01:37:36.160 --> 01:37:38.720
And I don’t want to
have these girlfriends, they are terrible,

01:37:38.720 --> 01:37:42.480
taxing people.
So can you get me a girlfriend?” So,

01:37:42.480 --> 01:37:44.560
I said, “All right,
you get engaged to someone,

01:37:44.560 --> 01:37:45.840
then you’ll feel happy”.

01:37:45.840 --> 01:37:51.280
So, I got him engaged. He’s only 17,
very happy with her.

01:37:51.280 --> 01:37:54.240
She’s Australian,
so he writes to her and all that,

01:37:54.240 --> 01:37:58.080
it’s nice. So he’s put into proper lines.

01:37:58.080 --> 01:38:00.720
With the girlfriends,
he was giving Me big,

01:38:00.720 --> 01:38:04.080
big stories how they trouble you,
and how they tax you

01:38:04.080 --> 01:38:09.910
and take you to the evening restaurant,
you have to pay for them.

01:38:09.910 --> 01:38:09.920
To discos.

01:38:09.920 --> 01:38:14.880
Discos. And also, this, what you call,
dates, dates.

01:38:14.880 --> 01:38:18.800
You have to have a date with the girls
and the man has to pay for the dates

01:38:19.360 --> 01:38:22.880
and all these things. He was quite worried
and he gave Me all the

01:38:22.880 --> 01:38:25.040
troubles one can have
from the girlfriends. So,

01:38:25.040 --> 01:38:26.720
he doesn’t want to have a girlfriend.

01:38:26.720 --> 01:38:31.040
But the other boys were teasing him,
“You are a coward. You are this,

01:38:31.040 --> 01:38:34.400
you are that”. So,

01:38:34.400 --> 01:38:38.000
He’s a born Realized,
he’s a very good boy. He said, “Baba,

01:38:38.000 --> 01:38:41.760
I don’t want to have any headaches
like this anymore”. In the school,

01:38:41.760 --> 01:38:43.760
you cannot exist without a girlfriend.

01:38:43.760 --> 01:38:46.720
Imagine, 17-year-old boy.

01:38:46.720 --> 01:38:50.320
Unbelievable. Here it’s not like this,
I guess. I’m not 17,

01:38:50.320 --> 01:38:55.913
but when I was 17 you could.
You need not to be.

01:38:55.913 --> 01:38:57.120
I mean that age is finished now.

01:38:57.120 --> 01:38:58.160
That age is finished now.

01:38:58.160 --> 01:38:58.960
Very different.

01:38:58.960 --> 01:39:00.240
Now even twelve years children.

01:39:00.240 --> 01:39:04.320
I mean even small children here,
talk of sex in a way that.

01:39:04.320 --> 01:39:06.640
We never give any sex
education to our children,

01:39:06.640 --> 01:39:08.720
there’s no need at all.
Only the parents should

01:39:08.720 --> 01:39:11.440
tell them about it,
not in the school collectively like that,

01:39:11.440 --> 01:39:15.040
openly. We don’t,
but it’s a private thing, so we tell them.

01:39:15.040 --> 01:39:17.600
And we don’t have these problems
as we don’t have rapes,

01:39:17.600 --> 01:39:21.920
we don’t have all these kinds of
pregnancies and all those things.

01:39:21.920 --> 01:39:25.600
Very rarely, very rarely.

01:39:25.600 --> 01:39:29.440
Because you talk so much about it,
it’s just to make them aware of

01:39:29.440 --> 01:39:34.160
something they should not know so much.

01:39:34.160 --> 01:39:36.080
Sex has become such an important thing.

01:39:36.080 --> 01:39:37.520
Oh yes.

01:39:37.520 --> 01:39:41.200
It’s quite a conditioning, Shri Mataji,
a big conditioning.

01:39:41.200 --> 01:39:45.760
Yeah, I must say.
I mean it’s such a natural thing.

01:39:45.760 --> 01:39:47.200
What is so great about sex?

01:39:47.200 --> 01:39:50.480
I just don’t understand. The birds,
the animals, everybody knows.

01:39:50.480 --> 01:39:53.920
No, I think if some people would
be really honest to themselves,

01:39:53.920 --> 01:39:55.760
they would say it’s not so great.

01:39:55.760 --> 01:39:58.080
Yes. And it’s not so important.

01:39:58.080 --> 01:40:00.160
No, it’s also not so great.

01:40:00.160 --> 01:40:01.680
Yes, if they are honest. But

01:40:03.280 --> 01:40:06.480
Even if they are honest, you see,
to face this mad world, you have to say,

01:40:06.480 --> 01:40:09.920
“No, I’m also sexy”. You see,
sort of thing.

01:40:09.920 --> 01:40:12.720
It’s horrible. It’s horrible.

01:40:12.720 --> 01:40:16.320
But it’s a very enslaving thing.

01:40:16.320 --> 01:40:20.160
It enslaves you. All these things in the
society enslave you.

01:40:20.160 --> 01:40:21.840
There’s no freedom in it.

01:40:21.840 --> 01:40:28.000
Anything like this kind of a norm,
you see, in these very respectable parties

01:40:28.000 --> 01:40:31.520
and things, I go, they talk this, I mean,
we both are shocked the

01:40:31.520 --> 01:40:34.640
way they talk things,
even grown-up people like us, you see,

01:40:34.640 --> 01:40:39.600
trying to be 20-year-old
and talking like stupid people.

01:40:39.600 --> 01:40:44.080
We just don’t understand how can they
talk of these things all the time.

01:40:44.080 --> 01:40:47.120
It’s something, you see, to be smart.

01:40:47.120 --> 01:40:51.200
In India, a person who is of
that age has to be wise,

01:40:51.200 --> 01:40:55.680
has to be matured, sensible, decent.

01:40:55.680 --> 01:41:01.120
But in the West now,
to be like that is oldish, you see. So,

01:41:01.120 --> 01:41:04.560
what’s the harm? I mean,
one should be proud of old age.

01:41:04.560 --> 01:41:07.360
It’s a matter of experience.

01:41:07.360 --> 01:41:10.640
It’s all upside down, I’m telling you,
the whole thing is.

01:41:10.640 --> 01:41:15.040
And because old are behaving
so childishly, children don’t respect.

01:41:15.040 --> 01:41:16.480
Yes, that’s true.

01:41:16.480 --> 01:41:22.320
Naturally. If they all behave
like the old people with dignity,

01:41:22.320 --> 01:41:24.640
they will respect.

01:41:24.640 --> 01:41:29.360
That’s a big problem, I think,
one faces when you see the

01:41:29.360 --> 01:41:34.640
way people insult the old.

01:41:34.640 --> 01:41:37.120
They never insulted Me, I’ve seen it.

01:41:37.120 --> 01:41:41.440
Even in any place I go, they like dignity.

01:41:43.440 --> 01:41:45.000
In fact, they are longing for it.

01:41:45.000 --> 01:41:47.120
Hum?
They are almost longing for it.

01:41:47.120 --> 01:41:50.960
Yes. Longing for it really, I tell you,
they are almost longing for dignity.

01:41:50.960 --> 01:41:55.360
They respect it. But the elderly people,
you see, think they…

01:41:58.160 --> 01:42:01.920
I don’t know why they behave,
but it’s kind of an insecurity in them.

01:42:01.920 --> 01:42:04.800
I tell you, these elderly people,
they think that,

01:42:04.800 --> 01:42:09.840
“We’ll be lost if you do not behave
like young people”. It must be that.

01:42:09.840 --> 01:42:13.920
Some sort of an insecurity exists in them.

01:42:13.920 --> 01:42:20.560
In the whole, lot of insecurities,
anxieties, too much anxieties.

01:42:20.560 --> 01:42:24.720
So anxious people are,
the slightest thing they start shaking,

01:42:24.720 --> 01:42:31.120
you see. Nerves are racking, absolutely,
what is… there is a racking going on.

01:42:31.120 --> 01:42:36.400
I don’t know what makes people so anxious.

01:42:36.400 --> 01:42:39.200
The nature is so beautiful.

01:42:39.200 --> 01:42:42.480
They don’t see it anymore.

01:42:42.480 --> 01:42:44.520
But here, the nature isn’t as beautiful.

01:42:44.520 --> 01:42:45.520
I beg your pardon?

01:42:45.520 --> 01:42:47.920
The nature here isn’t
so beautiful anymore.

01:42:47.920 --> 01:42:50.000
They destroy the nature, so.

01:42:50.000 --> 01:42:50.720
Really?

01:42:50.720 --> 01:42:56.880
Yes. You see the rivers,
they are now like that, like streets.

01:42:56.880 --> 01:42:58.000
Flooding.

01:42:58.000 --> 01:43:02.000
Straight.
There are no natural rivers anymore, they…

01:43:03.280 --> 01:43:05.440
everything destroyed.

01:43:05.440 --> 01:43:07.120
Ah.

01:43:07.120 --> 01:43:09.920
No integration with the nature,
Shri Mataji, anymore.

01:43:09.920 --> 01:43:12.320
They lost the connection.

01:43:12.320 --> 01:43:14.120
They think only nature
is for exploitation.

01:43:14.120 --> 01:43:14.640
Yes.

01:43:14.640 --> 01:43:16.880
This is the attitude they
have developed towards nature,

01:43:16.880 --> 01:43:20.960
is to exploit it. Oh, in India,
we still have beautiful rivers. Often,

01:43:20.960 --> 01:43:23.600
they all go and have bath, there.

01:43:25.360 --> 01:43:28.240
But what was the need?
There was no need to do that.

01:43:28.240 --> 01:43:34.315
What was the need? We use our, our…

01:43:34.315 --> 01:43:38.940
They wanted to overcome
the big Mother Earth.

01:43:38.940 --> 01:43:38.954
Yes, possible.

01:43:38.954 --> 01:43:42.320
Maybe that. But why? I mean,
she’s your mother,

01:43:43.200 --> 01:43:45.400
she’ll give you everything that you…

01:43:45.400 --> 01:43:46.240
Freedom.

01:43:46.240 --> 01:43:49.840
It’s a big fighting nature, I think,
just fight everyone, fight your mother,

01:43:49.840 --> 01:43:52.640
fight your father, fight everyone.

01:43:52.640 --> 01:43:54.160
She’s giving you everything.

01:43:54.160 --> 01:43:57.120
Why fight her? It’s too much.

01:43:57.120 --> 01:44:00.800
And this also machinery,
this machinery business, you see,

01:44:00.800 --> 01:44:07.120
exhausts. Machine is like a devil,
I tell you. Machine is just like a devil.

01:44:07.120 --> 01:44:11.520
It just devours everything.
It devours everything,

01:44:11.520 --> 01:44:15.840
everything that is beautiful, it devours,
machine.

01:44:15.840 --> 01:44:19.440
Because it cannot work unless you feed it,
feed it, feed it, you see,

01:44:19.440 --> 01:44:22.160
large scale production.
And then you have to exhaust

01:44:22.160 --> 01:44:24.640
the Mother Earth for that, isn’t it?

01:44:24.640 --> 01:44:28.240
To produce all this plastic
and all those things.

01:44:28.240 --> 01:44:29.840
That may be one of the reasons.

01:44:29.840 --> 01:44:33.120
But what is the advantage?
I don’t understand. Still,

01:44:33.120 --> 01:44:38.160
I don’t understand the advantage. I mean,
I agree in India,

01:44:38.160 --> 01:44:40.640
maybe we don’t have good telephones.

01:44:40.640 --> 01:44:44.800
But sometimes in England you
get fed up with telephones, I tell you.

01:44:44.800 --> 01:44:46.800
You want to put it out of the hook,
you see,

01:44:46.800 --> 01:44:48.800
so that you get fed up of telephones.

01:44:48.800 --> 01:44:51.920
But also, it’s a way of communication.

01:44:51.920 --> 01:44:53.907
It’s an easy way to communicate.

01:44:53.907 --> 01:44:56.160
It’s true. I need not to go somewhere
and see a person,

01:44:56.160 --> 01:44:58.000
but I can ring her up and…

01:44:58.000 --> 01:45:00.480
But it’s nice to go and see someone.

01:45:00.480 --> 01:45:05.680
Yes, but you see,
it’s less materialistic to talk

01:45:05.680 --> 01:45:07.840
to somebody on the phone then. You see…

01:45:07.840 --> 01:45:10.960
To talk on the phone you have to always
think you have to pay three pounds,

01:45:11.920 --> 01:45:14.320
then six pounds.
You go on thinking about the time,

01:45:14.320 --> 01:45:18.160
what’s the time now, etc. You see,
and while you want to see somebody,

01:45:18.160 --> 01:45:22.080
it’s better. Is to see somebody,
intensely, it’s better than to talk

01:45:22.080 --> 01:45:23.680
to somebody superficially.

01:45:23.680 --> 01:45:28.480
You see, to have intense feeling,
rapport intense is better than

01:45:28.480 --> 01:45:33.440
just to be talking on the, “Hello,
how are you, good morning”. Finished.

01:45:33.440 --> 01:45:36.320
Yes,
but you can be also intense on the phone.

01:45:36.320 --> 01:45:41.440
Normally people don’t do that
because they don’t do anything intensely.

01:45:41.440 --> 01:45:43.040
But you can, you could.

01:45:43.040 --> 01:45:55.360
You can, but they don’t
because the first consideration is money.

01:45:55.360 --> 01:46:00.160
Always, it is so. Of course, I mean,
telecommunications are there.

01:46:00.160 --> 01:46:04.960
It’s very good on the telephone because
I can give Realization on the telephone.

01:46:04.960 --> 01:46:07.200
I can cure people on the telephone.

01:46:07.200 --> 01:46:09.200
I’ve cured people on the telephone.

01:46:09.200 --> 01:46:10.960
You can soothe a person on telephone.

01:46:10.960 --> 01:46:15.200
It has good side also.
But it’s not used for that side.

01:46:15.200 --> 01:46:18.000
No,
but you can do it even without telephone,

01:46:18.000 --> 01:46:20.880
I guess. You can just by your…

01:46:20.880 --> 01:46:24.720
I can. That’s all.
One can because there’s the ether,

01:46:24.720 --> 01:46:26.480
divine ether which works out.

01:46:26.480 --> 01:46:28.000
Just sitting down here you can feel.

01:46:28.960 --> 01:46:30.640
You can do it. And it’s…

01:46:32.960 --> 01:46:36.320
still there is an urge among Sahaja Yogis,
that they should see Me.

01:46:36.320 --> 01:46:40.320
I don’t know why they
want to see Me in person.

01:46:40.320 --> 01:46:42.400
Though I can communicate
otherwise with them,

01:46:42.400 --> 01:46:47.120
but they must see Me in person,
and then they feel very joyous and happy.

01:46:47.120 --> 01:46:49.360
There’s some sort of a thing in there.

01:46:49.360 --> 01:46:52.880
They want to see Me in person.

01:46:52.880 --> 01:46:54.560
It’s true, I tell you.

01:46:54.560 --> 01:46:56.880
They feel very joyous to see Me in person.

01:46:56.880 --> 01:47:00.080
Though I’m quite a moderation to them,
for example, they have to,

01:47:00.080 --> 01:47:04.640
now I’m occupying his room here,
they give Me a special room here.

01:47:04.640 --> 01:47:06.400
It’s quite a problem for them.

01:47:06.400 --> 01:47:10.160
No, Mother. No problem, Shri Mataji.

01:47:10.160 --> 01:47:15.680
In love, you don’t feel anything. In love,
in love.

01:47:15.680 --> 01:47:17.440
What’s your age?

01:47:17.440 --> 01:47:20.400
I am now, how much, sixty-four?

01:47:20.400 --> 01:47:21.026
Sixty-fourth, yes.

01:47:21.026 --> 01:47:24.400
Sixty-fourth, I’m running now.

01:47:24.400 --> 01:47:26.640
Sixty-four years running well.

01:47:26.640 --> 01:47:28.400
Running well. Doing well.

01:47:28.400 --> 01:47:32.560
And 21 March is my birthday, 21 March.

01:47:32.560 --> 01:47:33.760
What is that?

01:47:33.760 --> 01:47:36.320
That’s an equinox.

01:47:36.320 --> 01:47:38.400
No, not cancer. Cancer is too late.

01:47:38.400 --> 01:47:43.520
No, no, no. I am between Aries and Pisces,
just on the cusp of it, twelve o’clock.

01:47:43.520 --> 01:47:46.720
I was born exactly at twelve
o’clock in the daytime.

01:47:46.720 --> 01:47:48.240
Between Pisces and?

01:47:48.240 --> 01:47:56.640
And Aries.

01:47:56.640 --> 01:47:58.400
Pisces and Aries.

01:47:58.400 --> 01:48:02.480
But I don’t think I am Aries or Pisces,
both. Because, you see,

01:48:02.480 --> 01:48:04.560
Aries people go on like this.

01:48:04.560 --> 01:48:08.000
My husband is Aries, he goes on like that,
you see. I don’t. So,

01:48:08.000 --> 01:48:10.160
it’s something beyond that, I think,
something.

01:48:10.160 --> 01:48:15.600
But I was born just at the equinox,
at the zero hour. The zero hour.

01:48:15.600 --> 01:48:16.160
Exactly?

01:48:16.160 --> 01:48:21.920
Exactly, at twelve o’clock.
When something,

01:48:21.920 --> 01:48:26.480
that they have cast my horoscope in India,
and it’s quite fantastic.

01:48:26.480 --> 01:48:39.120
I was amazed how horoscopes could
be quite exposing you completely.

01:48:39.120 --> 01:48:42.160
We have
so many ways of knowing a person in India.

01:48:42.160 --> 01:48:46.880
Our horoscope system is very systematic,
based on the Moon and all that,

01:48:46.880 --> 01:48:49.840
and all these gurus
change their birthdates.

01:48:49.840 --> 01:48:52.240
All of them change their birthdates.

01:48:52.240 --> 01:48:58.960
Like this one, the fourteen-year-old
fellow is six-six-six. He’s Antichrist.

01:48:58.960 --> 01:49:00.480
His birthday is six-six-six.

01:49:00.480 --> 01:49:03.360
Even Rajneesh’s they say six-six-six.
I don’t know,

01:49:03.360 --> 01:49:05.120
but that’s what the astrologer told Me.

01:49:05.120 --> 01:49:08.320
They change their birth dates,
all of them.

01:49:08.320 --> 01:49:09.200
Why?

01:49:09.200 --> 01:49:11.680
Because they would be found out in India.

01:49:11.680 --> 01:49:12.800
But they really are.

01:49:12.800 --> 01:49:14.960
Oh, I see.

01:49:14.960 --> 01:49:15.840
On the horoscope.

01:49:15.840 --> 01:49:18.560
Yes, but they have to choose
then a very good date.

01:49:19.440 --> 01:49:20.480
That is not possible.

01:49:20.480 --> 01:49:22.960
That is in the hands of God, you see.

01:49:22.960 --> 01:49:28.160
The sinister fellow is born
on a sinister day only.

01:49:28.160 --> 01:49:34.000
That way God is very helpful.

01:49:34.000 --> 01:49:35.920
I’m afraid I have to go now.

01:49:35.920 --> 01:49:39.520
Yes. I need to have another person about,
within five minutes time,

01:49:39.520 --> 01:49:44.320
some other person is coming
from another magazine. It’s a magazine,

01:49:44.320 --> 01:49:45.520
isn’t it?

01:49:45.520 --> 01:49:45.991
Yes. Esoteric magazine, ‘Esotera’ .

01:49:45.991 --> 01:49:52.480
Esoteric.
He got also his Realisation yesterday.

01:49:52.480 --> 01:49:55.760
He was a four years Buddhist monk.

01:49:55.760 --> 01:49:58.480
Maybe you know Reverend…

01:49:58.480 --> 01:49:59.885
No, no, no.

01:49:59.885 --> 01:49:59.901
Reverend Radha .

01:49:59.901 --> 01:50:01.910
No, no, no, no, no.
Buddhist monk is different.

01:50:01.910 --> 01:50:03.360
Ah OK. He is nice one thought.

01:50:03.360 --> 01:50:05.440
That’s the one. This is another one.

01:50:05.440 --> 01:50:07.520
This is another one.
I’ve forgotten his name

01:50:07.520 --> 01:50:09.040
Reverend Radha .

01:50:09.040 --> 01:50:10.480
No, no, this is another one.

01:50:10.480 --> 01:50:12.320
Oh.
You’re talking about the radio station.

01:50:12.320 --> 01:50:15.280
Yes, yes. No, no, not the radio station.
The other one

01:50:15.280 --> 01:50:17.360
who came for the magazine of esoteric.

01:50:17.360 --> 01:50:19.360
Yes, that’s him. That’s Reverend Radha.

01:50:19.360 --> 01:50:20.080
He’s the one?

01:50:20.080 --> 01:50:20.480
Yes.

01:50:20.480 --> 01:50:22.080
I see.

01:50:22.080 --> 01:50:23.840
Oh, yes, he is coming.

01:50:23.840 --> 01:50:26.480
He’s probably just here
now somewhere else. He was here.

01:50:26.480 --> 01:50:27.840
He was waiting all the time.

01:50:27.840 --> 01:50:31.840
He was here yesterday.

01:50:34.960 --> 01:50:37.600
Brought a lady also.
She also got Realisation. He said,

01:50:37.600 --> 01:50:41.280
“Look at her, how she’s happy”.
He showed Me from there.

01:50:41.280 --> 01:50:44.880
He raised his both hands. He said,
“Look at this one, how she’s happy”.

01:50:44.880 --> 01:50:47.440
But she was doubting very much, this lady.

01:50:47.440 --> 01:50:48.800
And then she got her Realisation.

01:50:48.800 --> 01:50:50.880
She started to enjoy it, as it is.

01:50:50.880 --> 01:50:56.160
He said, “Now see how she’s happy”.

01:50:56.160 --> 01:51:00.960
It convinces you, you see,
once you get Realisation. And that’s how.

01:51:04.960 --> 01:51:06.160
Just help her.

01:51:06.160 --> 01:51:09.360
No, it’s all right, you see.
I have something…

01:51:09.360 --> 01:51:12.160
After all,
a woman must have her advantages,

01:51:12.160 --> 01:51:19.280
at least.

01:51:19.280 --> 01:51:22.800
Yes. And are you married?

01:51:22.800 --> 01:51:25.440
No, I’m not. I never married.

01:51:25.440 --> 01:51:26.240
You never married.

01:51:26.240 --> 01:51:27.840
I didn’t want to marry.

01:51:27.840 --> 01:51:29.840
You will now very soon, I think.

01:51:30.720 --> 01:51:31.520
I don’t think I…

01:51:31.520 --> 01:51:33.664
We will see.

01:51:33.664 --> 01:51:35.600
We will see now.
I will have to, so much.

01:51:35.600 --> 01:51:42.000
But a small part in me always regretted,
of course, that I didn’t marry.

01:51:42.000 --> 01:51:45.200
No, it is conditioning. You see, here,
the marriages are so horrid

01:51:45.200 --> 01:51:47.744
and so when you see them, you just get so…

01:51:47.744 --> 01:51:48.320
Yes, it’s not so funny.

01:51:48.320 --> 01:51:52.400
No, that’s so funny, really. So,
you don’t want to have it. It’s correct.

01:51:52.400 --> 01:51:53.120
I agree with you.

01:51:53.120 --> 01:51:56.080
Because when you see everything mad, yes,
it’s naturally…

01:51:56.080 --> 01:51:58.720
But I have a very,
very good friend to my heart,

01:51:58.720 --> 01:52:04.240
since six years.
And it’s the best man I ever met.

01:52:04.240 --> 01:52:06.480
So that’s all about. For us,
it’s a marriage.

01:52:06.480 --> 01:52:07.840
So, it’s a marriage, yes.

01:52:07.840 --> 01:52:11.520
We call it Gandharva Viva.
It’s a marriage.

01:52:11.520 --> 01:52:14.400
But he’s very difficult.
I must say tell you.

01:52:14.400 --> 01:52:16.560
No, bring him tonight.

01:52:16.560 --> 01:52:18.800
Yes, bring him along. Yes, yes, yes!

01:52:18.800 --> 01:52:20.331
Then he’ll be nice, soft.

01:52:20.331 --> 01:52:21.360
Yes, yes, it will be nice, yes.
He’s a…

01:52:22.080 --> 01:52:23.988
Just help her to take it down.
It’s too heavy.

01:52:23.988 --> 01:52:25.760
…disciple of a guru in India.

01:52:25.760 --> 01:52:26.640
Which one is he?

01:52:26.640 --> 01:52:29.317
The one I asked you.

01:52:29.317 --> 01:52:29.360
The brothers…
The Kirpa, the Kirpal Singh.

01:52:29.360 --> 01:52:32.400
Oh, her man is a disciple
of this Kirpal Singh.

01:52:32.400 --> 01:52:33.760
How is his heart?

01:52:33.760 --> 01:52:35.200
He is fine.

01:52:35.200 --> 01:52:37.400
Are you sure? Are you sure.

01:52:37.400 --> 01:52:38.160
yes.

01:52:38.160 --> 01:52:39.200
I can’t believe it.

01:52:39.200 --> 01:52:41.680
You know that Kirpal Singh died in ’74.

01:52:41.680 --> 01:52:43.920
I know, I know, I know.
He had a heart also.

01:52:43.920 --> 01:52:45.520
He died of a heart attack.

01:52:46.160 --> 01:52:47.120
Yes, he had a massive heart attack.

01:52:47.120 --> 01:52:48.160
It’s stomach, I think.

01:52:48.160 --> 01:52:51.120
No, no. He had a massive heart attack.

01:52:51.120 --> 01:52:53.200
He went to the hospital for his stomach.

01:52:53.200 --> 01:52:55.120
But then he got a massive heart attack.

01:52:55.120 --> 01:52:56.800
He died of a heart attack.

01:52:56.800 --> 01:52:58.000
Yes?

01:52:58.000 --> 01:52:59.680
He had three heart attacks.

01:52:59.680 --> 01:53:01.840
But you see,
the stomach is the area of the guru.

01:53:01.840 --> 01:53:05.749
Guru, yes. That should be the best.

01:53:05.749 --> 01:53:07.600
Your false gurus and the stupid .

01:53:07.600 --> 01:53:09.920
If you do something wrong, you catch here.

01:53:09.920 --> 01:53:12.080
No, it’s all right.
If his heart is all right,

01:53:12.080 --> 01:53:14.880
he’ll get Realisation.
But this fellow poised heart.

01:53:14.880 --> 01:53:17.200
It’s the big problem.
But he’ll get Realisation.

01:53:17.200 --> 01:53:20.000
Once he gets Realisation,
then it’s all right. Then you are there.

01:53:20.000 --> 01:53:22.160
You become your own gurus.
Why do you have to have

01:53:22.160 --> 01:53:22.960
gurus for nothing at all?

01:53:22.960 --> 01:53:24.160
No, no, I don’t.

01:53:24.160 --> 01:53:26.080
No, no, not. But him also.

01:53:26.080 --> 01:53:28.240
Well, yes, he needed, so…

01:53:28.240 --> 01:53:30.045
Might be. But now he will not need.

01:53:30.045 --> 01:53:30.075
He should become his own guru.

01:53:30.075 --> 01:53:34.640
That need should be over. I’ve seen,
I’ve seen all this.

01:53:34.640 --> 01:53:38.160
Oh, yes, in a way,
he has developed in this direction…

01:53:38.160 --> 01:53:41.280
Yes, yes.

01:53:41.280 --> 01:53:42.640
All right. So, what’s your name?

01:53:42.640 --> 01:53:43.920
You didn’t tell Me your name.

01:53:43.920 --> 01:53:44.800
Krista.

01:53:44.800 --> 01:53:45.360
Krista.

01:53:45.360 --> 01:53:48.320
Yes, it’s the female version of Christ.

01:53:48.320 --> 01:53:52.230
That’s great.

01:53:52.230 --> 01:53:53.352
All right.
May God bless you, Krista.

01:53:53.352 --> 01:53:54.080
Best to you.

01:53:54.080 --> 01:53:54.720
Thank you, thank you.

01:53:54.720 --> 01:53:55.240
Thank you very much.

01:53:55.240 --> 01:53:57.520
I hope to see you this evening.
Bring your friend.

01:53:57.546 --> 01:53:57.946
Yes.

01:53:58.000 --> 01:54:02.400
Somehow. All right? Somehow. Again,
same trick.

01:54:02.400 --> 01:54:02.880
She’s good.

01:54:02.880 --> 01:54:07.200
Yes.
She’s a good girl. Good girl.

